---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Patient Tools"
  description="MBS Medical patient tools and resources. Book appointments, access your patient portal, and learn about our telehealth services."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section bg-cream" style="padding-top: 7rem; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom left, rgba(239,207,143,0.3) 0%, rgba(239,207,143,0) 55%), var(--surface-cream);">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">patient resources</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Tools and resources</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Everything you need to book, connect, and manage your care. All in one place.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Tools grid -->
  <section class="section bg-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="tools-grid">

        <div class="reveal tool-card tool-card--featured">
          <span class="accent-chip chip-terracotta">primary</span>
          <h2>Book an appointment</h2>
          <p>Same-week availability. Evening slots included. Secure online booking takes less than two minutes.</p>
          <a href="https://mbsmedical.practicebetter.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            open booking portal
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 tool-card">
          <span class="accent-chip chip-sage">portal</span>
          <h2>Patient portal</h2>
          <p>Access your visit records, lab results, and care plan. Message your provider securely.</p>
          <a href="https://mbsmedical.practicebetter.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            log in to portal
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 tool-card">
          <span class="accent-chip chip-sky">telehealth</span>
          <h2>Join a video visit</h2>
          <p>Ready for your appointment? Join your secure telehealth session. You'll need the link from your confirmation email.</p>
          <a href="https://mbsmedical.practicebetter.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            join visit
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal tool-card">
          <span class="accent-chip chip-coral">contact</span>
          <h2>Message us</h2>
          <p>Non-urgent questions, refill requests, or general inquiries. We respond within one business day.</p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            send a message
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 tool-card">
          <span class="accent-chip chip-butter">learn</span>
          <h2>Our services</h2>
          <p>Browse all 11 specialties we offer. Not sure what you need? Read through and see what fits, or just ask us.</p>
          <a href="/services/" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            browse services
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 tool-card">
          <span class="accent-chip chip-terracotta">team</span>
          <h2>Meet your providers</h2>
          <p>Learn about the team behind your care: backgrounds, specialties, and the values that drive how we practice.</p>
          <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            meet the team
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Quick info -->
  <section class="section bg-sand">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reveal quick-info-grid">
        <div class="quick-info-item">
          <h3>Hours</h3>
          <p>Monday through Friday, 9am to 6pm. Evening appointments available. We will do our best to accommodate outside standard hours when possible.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="quick-info-item">
          <h3>Payment</h3>
          <p>We are a cash-pay practice. No insurance accepted. We accept credit cards, debit cards, HSA, and FSA. A superbill can be provided for potential reimbursement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="quick-info-item">
          <h3>Prescriptions</h3>
          <p>Prescriptions are sent electronically to your preferred pharmacy. Most can be fulfilled within 24 hours of your visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="quick-info-item">
          <h3>Labs</h3>
          <p>We order labs through major national labs. Most patients can complete their draw at a location within a few miles. Results are reviewed with you at your follow-up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>


<style>
  .tools-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .tools-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .tools-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }

  .tool-card {
    background-color: var(--surface-shell);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .tool-card h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .tool-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    flex: 1;
  }
  .tool-card--featured {
    background-color: var(--surface-peach);
    border-color: rgba(232,116,97,0.2);
  }

  .quick-info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .quick-info-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .quick-info-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  }
  .quick-info-item h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .quick-info-item p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
  }
</style>
